# Text is stored and checked out with LF line endings on every platform, so
# the assets the binary embeds (docs, contracts, SQL, prompts, skills), the
# files tests hash or read, and the sources match byte for byte everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The WiX source is committed with CRLF and generated by cargo-dist: kept
# exactly as committed.
crates/neosian/wix/main.wxs -text
